This repo is a live team demo for GarageGuru's agentic SDLC operating model.

Walk the GG-142 booking-cancellation slice: messy notes in `docs/00-incoming/`, clarified requirements in `docs/01-requirements/`, Jira drafts in `docs/02-jira/`, then the running apps in `apps/api` and `apps/web`.

AI prepares artifacts and can implement on a branch. Humans keep requirement approval, PR merge, and production release.
